<title>JAPAN: Japan May crude imports up 0.4 percent yr/yr--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan May crude imports up 0.4 percent yr/yr--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's crude oil imports in May climbed 0.4 percent from a year earlier to 20.61 million kl, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Month-on-month, the May figure was down 9.7 percent from April.</p>
</text>
